- Service observability and secure networking

## Future Improvements

Potential improvements include:

- Distributed tracing with OpenTelemetry.
- Centralized logging and alerting.
- Automated integration and end-to-end testing.
- Idempotent event consumers and dead-letter queues.
- Rate limiting, circuit breakers, and retry policies.
- Horizontal autoscaling and performance benchmarking.
- Improved authentication, authorization, and secrets management.

